r les oignons.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Ensuite, on les met \u00e0 frire avec de l'ail.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Enfin, verse la sauce sur les p\u00e2tes et ajoute du parmesan r\u00e2p\u00e9. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la sauce", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une pr\u00e9paration de consistance liquide qui accompagne certains plats", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Comment pr\u00e9pare-t-on une bonne sauce tomate ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le04ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour parler de cuisine et de nourriture.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hacher", "type": "name"}, {"content": "couper un aliment en tr\u00e8s petits morceaux", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il faut hacher les tomates.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le04ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'oignon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le bulbe d'une plante utilis\u00e9 comme ingr\u00e9dient dans de nombreuses recettes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Il faut hacher les oignons.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le04ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "frire ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cuire dans de l'huile tr\u00e8s chaude", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Tu peux frire les oignons avec les tomates.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le04ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'ail", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le bulbe d'une plante, au go\u00fbt tr\u00e8s fort et piquant, utilis\u00e9 dans 